{title: Kade Ta Tu Avenga}
{artist: Runbir}
{key: Bm}

{c: Verse 1}
Kade tan tu [Bm] avenga ve,        ose hi [Em] chaurahe te
Jehde si [A] chaurahe te,        gya saanu [F#] chhad ke
Jandi vari [Bm] pith v,        ghuma k piche [Em] takeya na
Khade rahe [A] laake aasan,        akhiyan nu [F#] add ke
Akhon holl [Bm] hoya si,        ja veehi wale [Em] mod ton
Jindjaan [A] sohneya tu,        le gya si [F#] kadh ke
Enjh taan koi [Bm] khed k,        khidoneya nu [Em] sutt da na
Jinwe mainu [A] sutt gya,        zindagi cho tu [F#] kadh k
Eadon nalo [Bm] changa iko,        vari maar [Em] dinda mainu
Kyu [A] kardea halaal pota,        pota injh [F#m] vadh k
[Bm] Hun vi tu nagreya,        [G] janda naa bhulaeya maithon
[A] Tu tan mere rach gya vich,        [F#m] rag rag de [Bm]
Kade tan tu [Bm] avenga ve,        ose hi [Em] chaurahe te
Jehde si [A] chaurahe te,        gya saanu [F#] chhad ke
Jandi vari [Bm] pith v,        ghuma k piche [Em] takeya na
Khade rahe [A] laake aasan,        akhiyan nu [F#] add ke
Kyu hasna [Bm] sikhaya si,        je ena tu [Em] tadpana si
Kyu laad [A] ladaya si,        je ena tu [F#] satauna si
[Bm] Tainu dil ch vasaya c,        [G] dhadkan di thaan te
Tu [A] dil hi kadh k le gya,        [F#m] seene lag [Bm] ke
